  ex:hasUsage "水煎服。" .

<medicine:丹毒至效散> a ex:Medicine;
  ex:hasAlias "至效散";
  ex:hasFunction "小儿一切丹毒，及龙带发作。";
  ex:hasName "丹毒至效散";
  ex:hasPreparation "上为末。";
