  ex:hasName "断根散";
  ex:hasPreparation "上为末。";
  ex:hasPrescription "海螵蛸（火煅）。";
  ex:hasUsage "每服大人5钱，小儿2钱，黑砂糖拌匀调下。" .

<medicine:断汗汤> a ex:Medicine;
  ex:hasFunction "主自汗。";
