  ex:hasUsage "每服1钱半，食后、临卧服，或秦皮煎汤下。" .

<medicine:海桐散> a ex:Medicine;
  ex:hasFunction "手足伤。";
  ex:hasName "海桐散";
  ex:hasPreparation "上为细末。";
