  ex:hasPreparation "上炼和。";
  ex:hasPrescription "硫黄18钱，硇砂2钱，家猪脂32钱。";
  ex:hasUsage "涂患部。" .

<medicine:疥药一扫光> a ex:Medicine;
  ex:hasFunction "疥疮。";
