  ex:hasUsage "每服3钱，用茴香汤或酒任下。" .

<medicine:破故纸散> a ex:Medicine;
  ex:hasFunction "治小儿遗尿。";
  ex:hasName "破故纸散";
  ex:hasPreparation "上药为末。";
  ex:hasPrescription "破故纸30克（炒）";
  ex:hasUsage "每服3克，热汤调下。" .

<medicine:破棺丹> a ex:Medicine;
