<medicine:蓝饮子> a ex:Medicine;
  ex:hasFunction "解砒毒及巴豆毒。主";
  ex:hasName "蓝饮子";
  ex:hasPrescription "蓝根、沙糖。";
  ex:hasUsage "上相和，擂水服之；或更入薄荷汁尤妙。" .

<medicine:蓟叶汤> a ex:Medicine;
  ex:hasFunction "热病吐血。";
