  ex:hasUsage "每服20丸，食前生姜汤送下。" .

<medicine:藿香乌药散> a ex:Medicine;
  ex:hasFunction "霍乱。";
  ex:hasName "藿香乌药散";
  ex:hasPreparation "上为粗末。";
