  ex:hasPreparation "上为散。";
  ex:hasPrescription "槟榔8两，车前子8两。";
  ex:hasUsage "每服3钱，米饮调下。" .

<medicine:解郁散毒汤> a ex:Medicine;
  ex:hasFunction "血胤疮，腋疬。";
