<medicine:马齿煎> a ex:Medicine;
  ex:hasFunction "痔疮。疮肿下血。";
  ex:hasName "马齿煎";
  ex:hasPreparation "熟捣，绞取汁，缓火煎成膏，停冷。";
  ex:hasPrescription "马齿苋（洗去土）。";
